    buildings — the towers as building:part from Andrew Fisher's second download — roads, water, beach and parks,
    put into key-plan coordinates by the registration. A build product; rebuilt here if it is missing, and None
    (no 3D backdrop offered) when the download itself is not in the package. Received from Andrew Fisher as
    GC500_3D_Scene_v0.4 on 17 Sep 2026 — see docs/gc3d/."""
    f = ROOT / 'print/surrounds_pack.json'
