    """The showcase's generated sound clips (pipeline/gc3d/build_sound.py from sources/sound/), embedded so the
    file edition plays from file://. None until Andrew Fisher's picks are in sources/sound/ — the page then runs
    the scene without clips and its log says so."""
    f = ROOT / 'print/web/show_sound.json'
