    size and parts count, so the Coates Way tab can say what it is before it is opened. The machine's files are
    not embedded — they are imported on the admin page and served at /w/<key>/ (v5.77). None until the step has
    run, and then the tab says the machine is part of the build but not on this service."""
    f = ROOT / 'print/web/machine_meta.json'
