    """The broadcast programme (pipeline/broadcast.py from sources/broadcast/), embedded so the file edition
    plays it from file:// and the hosted build pulls the takes back out into the media folder by their own
    hash. None until the spine is there; a spine with no takes yet still travels, so the programme runs the
    scenes at the right pace and the page can say which turns are still to come."""
    f = ROOT / 'print/web/broadcast.json'
