       so a person typing it on the edit table changes what the register, the drawer, the map title, the load
       brief, the advice email and every printed sheet say — without eighty-four renderers each learning a new
       rule, and without the schedule's own wording being lost. */
    const desc = (S.descs || {})[a.key];
