       the plates read. The schedule's own item and quantity are kept on the line (`item_on_the_schedule`,
       `quantity_on_the_schedule`) and shown under the box in grey. A typed quantity is a whole number a person
       has put their name to, so a line the schedule left unpriceable for want of a readable count becomes
