/* THE RENTAL SYSTEM'S CONTRACT COUNTS AS THE RENTAL ID. Andrew Fisher, 17 Sep 2026 (tester audit): the Register
   read "193 assets with no Rental ID yet" and "Rental contracts 0" while the rental extract of 11 Sep carried
   fifteen lines on three contracts, matched line by line to the forklifts, the towers and the message boards.
   Asked, he said yes: a line the rental system has on hire is on that contract, credited to the rental system
