    <b>Photo unavailable</b>
    <span>The record points at a file the service does not have${p ? ': ' : '.'}${p ? `<code>${esc(p)}</code>` : ''}</span>
    <span class="w">Take it again from the drop, or upload it on the Documents tab.</span></div>`;
