   shared service last told us. The header used to carry a green dot beside the words "shared record" and
   nothing else — no time, no distinction between connected and merely hopeful.

   So: one state, one line of words, one timestamp, and the timestamp is when the SERVICE last answered. There
   is no animation on any of it. A pulsing green dot reads as a live feed to anybody who glances at it, and this
   page must never imply a freshness it cannot stand behind.

     shared    Shared record · last confirmed HH:MM
     pending   Changes pending · N waiting to send
     checking  Checking…
     offline   Offline · records saved in this browser
     view      View only · this link cannot change the record
